      "rationale": "Reading this as a pulsatile internal-flow screen. The cycle is periodic, so I will decompose it into a few steady phase points, solve each, and cycle-weight the result \u2014 after the Chief Researcher rules the decomposition admissible for this Womersley number. Basis: screens a pulsatile internal flow by decomposing the cycle into phase points.",
