    "event": "transcript.entry",
    "mission_id": "m-3fe1dd4f7410",
    "payload": {
      "role": "CHIEF RESEARCHER",
      "message": "\u2022 Internal flow, pulsatile but periodic. \u2022 Periodic forcing converts to a few steady phase points, weighted back together.",
      "citations": [],
      "citations_display": [],
      "data": {},
      "at": 1784839770.0660949
    }
  },
  {
    "sequence": 9,
    "timestamp": 1784839770.067094,
    "event": "transcript.entry",
    "mission_id": "m-3fe1dd4f7410",
    "payload": {
      "role": "CHIEF RESEARCHER",
      "message": "\u2022 Womersley \u03b1 \u2248 16.7: above the strict limit 1, inertially unsteady. \u2022 Under the screening ceiling 25, admissible as a SCREEN. \u2022 Dropped phase-interaction rides as model-form in the channel table.",
      "citations": [],
      "citations_display": [],
      "data": {},
      "at": 1784839770.067094
    }
  },
  {
    "sequence": 10,
    "timestamp": 1784839770.0685346,
    "event": "transcript.entry",
    "mission_id": "m-3fe1dd4f7410",
    "payload": {
      "role": "CHIEF RESEARCHER",
      "message": "\u2022 Strategy: 3-point cycle decomposition, weights accelerating 0.25, peak 0.50, decelerating 0.25. \u2022 Objective: cycle-weighted pressure loss; each phase a steady problem. \u2022 Gradients stay cheap at every phase point.",
      "citations": [],
      "citations_display": [],
      "data": {},
      "at": 1784839770.0685346
    }
  },
  {
    "sequence": 11,
    "timestamp": 1784839770.0685346,
    "event": "transcript.entry",
    "mission_id": "m-3fe1dd4f7410",
    "payload": {
      "role": "CHIEF RESEARCHER",
      "message": "\u2022 Rejected: single snapshot, prices one instant as the whole cycle. \u2022 Deferred to agenda: harmonic-balance cycle solve; unsteady FSI for moving leaflets.",
      "citations": [],
      "citations_display": [],
      "data": {},
      "at": 1784839770.0685346
    }
  },
  {
    "sequence": 12,
    "timestamp": 1784839770.0700536,
    "event": "agenda.updated",
    "mission_id": "m-3fe1dd4f7410",
    "payload": {
      "entries": [
        {
          "title": "Harmonic-balance cycle solve",
          "scope": "resolve phase-interaction the multi-point screen drops, solving the coupled harmonics of one cycle instead of independent phase points",
          "cost": "~1 order of magnitude over the multi-point screen"
        },
        {
          "title": "Unsteady fluid\u2013structure interaction",
          "scope": "move the leaflets, coupling the flow to leaflet dynamics so opening is solved, not prescribed",
          "cost": "~2 orders of magnitude; transient FSI, remeshing"
        },
        {
          "title": "Non-Newtonian blood rheology",
          "scope": "replace the Newtonian viscosity with a shear-thinning model in the orifice jet and wake",
          "cost": "modest over a Newtonian solve; a constitutive-model swap"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
